OL,3,GNEWSAFerry service remains suspended
OL,4,Aafter engine fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger ferry service between
OL,7,FJersey and Guernsey will remain
OL,8,Fsuspended after an engine problem.
OL,10,FOperator Islands Unlimited, which runs
OL,11,Fa daily inter-island foot passenger
OL,12,Fservice, said the MV San Pawl's
OL,13,Fstarboard main engine had a "major
OL,14,Ffailure".
OL,16,FThe company announced on Friday
OL,17,Fservices would not run until further
OL,18,Fnotice while engineers carried out a
OL,19,Ffull assessment of the vessel and
OL,20,Fworked to establish the extent of the
OL,21,Ffault.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
