OL,3,GNEWSAFerry service remains suspended
OL,4,Aafter engine fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update on social media, it said
OL,7,F"all passenger services scheduled up to
OL,8,Fand including 10 September have been
OL,9,Fcancelled" and it would confirm later
OL,10,Fwhether future sailings could operate
OL,11,For if there would be additional
OL,12,Fcancellations.
